sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Two buffering stages in IoT lake ingestion
accDescr: Basic Ingest routes telemetry to Firehose, which buffers for transformation and again for S3 delivery.
participant S as Sensors
participant I as IoT rules engine
participant F as Data Firehose
participant L as Lambda enrichment
participant B as S3 data lake
S->>I: Publish Basic Ingest topic
Note over S,I: Authenticated connection, broker bypassed
I->>F: Firehose rule action
Note over F: Short transformation buffer
F->>L: Batch of records
L-->>F: Enriched records
Note over F: S3 buffer: 300 seconds or size threshold
F->>B: Write buffered objects
Note over S,B: Budget includes both buffers and processing
